869
00:50:47,910 --> 00:50:48,880
Here's the deal.

870
00:50:49,040 --> 00:50:50,600
Let's do our best.

871
00:50:54,050 --> 00:50:55,240
If something's flawed,

872
00:50:55,260 --> 00:50:56,400
we'll fix it.

873
00:50:57,600 --> 00:50:59,080
If you still dream,

874
00:51:00,030 --> 00:51:01,600
keep chasing after it.

875
00:51:02,100 --> 00:51:02,900
Are you gonna sit here

876
00:51:02,920 --> 00:51:04,000
dwelling on your own thoughts

877
00:51:04,620 --> 00:51:06,160
or give your dream another shot?

878
00:51:06,800 --> 00:51:07,840
Is he...

879
00:51:08,300 --> 00:51:09,480
Thee as in TheeJuno?

880
00:51:10,080 --> 00:51:11,360
The one who got into an accident?

881
00:51:12,890 --> 00:51:14,680
Yes, that Thee.

882
00:51:24,060 --> 00:51:25,400
Actually, the main couple

883
00:51:26,280 --> 00:51:28,460
in 'The Deep Between Us'
were Thee and Juno.

884
00:51:30,990 --> 00:51:32,600
He really wanted to act in this series,

885
00:51:33,760 --> 00:51:35,360
so when I had to take over,

886
00:51:35,680 --> 00:51:36,960
I worked so hard on it.

887
00:51:40,520 --> 00:51:42,400
That's why I acted like that

888
00:51:44,440 --> 00:51:45,680
