889
00:51:50,500 --> 00:51:51,640
I'm sorry.

890
00:51:52,740 --> 00:51:54,520
I really had no clue.

891
00:51:58,810 --> 00:52:00,240
I had too high expectations.

892
00:52:01,220 --> 00:52:02,260
I'm sorry, too.

893
00:52:06,300 --> 00:52:08,510
It's hard for me to talk about
Thee's accident.

894
00:52:10,880 --> 00:52:12,160
I've never been able to accept it.

895
00:52:13,600 --> 00:52:14,860
Sometimes, I blame myself.

896
00:52:17,480 --> 00:52:18,400
Don't blame yourself.

897
00:52:18,420 --> 00:52:20,760
Everyone's doing their best
in their own way.

898
00:52:25,000 --> 00:52:27,460
