913
00:53:05,790 --> 00:53:07,160
They might have guidance for you.

914
00:53:09,200 --> 00:53:10,120
Sounds good.

915
00:53:10,640 --> 00:53:12,640
I'll ask Wut and see if I can.

916
00:53:13,990 --> 00:53:14,840
What about you?

917
00:53:15,920 --> 00:53:18,600
If you weren't an actor,
