918
00:53:26,660 --> 00:53:27,660
Einstein.

919
00:53:28,090 --> 00:53:28,720
Huh?

920
00:53:29,980 --> 00:53:31,440
Are you just tryna get on my nerves?

921
00:53:31,670 --> 00:53:32,480
Why?

922
00:53:32,690 --> 00:53:34,040
It'd be cool to be like him.

923
00:53:35,800 --> 00:53:37,680
So there's a nerdy side to you.

924
00:53:39,300 --> 00:53:40,760
I like science.

925
00:53:41,630 --> 00:53:43,320
I may not look like it,
but I'm a chemistry nerd.

926
00:53:44,420 --> 00:53:46,360
At first, I planned to apply to
the Faculty of Science.

927
00:53:47,280 --> 00:53:48,880
But I found my calling as an actor first,

928
00:53:49,220 --> 00:53:49,820
so I went with Comm Arts

929
00:53:49,840 --> 00:53:50,880
and majored in performing arts.

930
00:53:53,680 --> 00:53:54,680
Honestly,

931
00:53:55,800 --> 00:53:57,200
I couldn't have told

932
00:53:57,220 --> 00:53:59,460
you were a chemistry nerd
if you hadn't told me.

933
00:54:00,460 --> 00:54:01,240
So...

934
00:54:01,780 --> 00:54:03,340
