935
00:54:04,340 --> 00:54:06,360
There's... a lot.

936
00:54:07,600 --> 00:54:08,920
Wanna get to know me?

937
00:54:10,790 --> 00:54:12,320
Should we take turns asking questions?

938
00:54:13,090 --> 00:54:13,680
Mm.

939
00:54:13,700 --> 00:54:14,960
Then, I'll go first.

940
00:54:15,520 --> 00:54:16,660
What do you usually do

941
